---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"Support Plans | Roos Instruments"}
  description={"Roos Instrument's world class support for production ATE with rapid response times and direct access to development teams, including Calibration and Engineering Support."}
  active={["nav-support"]}>
    <!-- ==========================
    	BREADCRUMB - START
    =========================== -->
    <section class="breadcrumb-wrapper">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Support Plans</h2>
        <ol class="breadcrumb">
          <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="support.html">Support</a></li>
          <li class="active">Support Plans</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- ==========================
    	BREADCRUMB - END
    =========================== -->

    <div id="content" class="roosC container">
      <h2>Cassini Support</h2>
      <p class="main">World class support for production ATE with rapid response times and direct access to development
        teams.</p>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h2>Extended Warranty</h2>
            <img class="centerImg" style="max-width: 114px; max-height: 153px;" alt="'W' = Extended Warranty"
              src="images/support-W-icon.png">
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Get Help via Phone &amp; Web</li>
            <li>TIM Repair Labor and Hardware</li>
            <li>Technical Support for Production</li>
            <li>Vital for Production Testing</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="main">
            Maintains your ATE's performance and uptime by providing a "return to factory" repair and service option.
            Use our expertise to identify and resolve all production issues. Access online documentation 24 hours a day.
            Does not include replacing
            <a href="https://roos.com/docs/RBEH-7RDTV8?Open">designated RI Accessories</a> or RI Kits. A
            <a href="https://roos.com/parts/RIK0048A" title="RIK0048A System Eval">System Evaluation</a> is required
            when service
            has lapsed, the system has been relocated, or the title of the system has been transferred.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h2>Software Subscription</h2>
            <img class="centerImg" style="max-width: 114px; max-height: 153px;" alt="'S' = Software Subscription"
              src="images/support-S-icon.png">
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Major &amp; Minor Version Upgrades</li>
            <li>Guru Server Improvements</li>
            <li>Firmware Performance Enhancements</li>
            <li>Virtual Workstation Updates</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="main">
            Access update streams for all licensed seats of ATE, Virtual Workstation, and Guru Server. Includes
            advancements in testplan buttons, calibration and error adapter techniques, data viewers &amp; worksheets,
            calibration, verification, and diagnostic testplans,
            user interface tools, and editing tools. Released electronically as needed or when requested. Already have
            Software Subscription,
            <a href="mailto:support@roos.com">send us feedback</a> on features and customization requests.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h2>Preventive Maint &amp; Calibration</h2>
            <img class="centerImg" style="max-width: 127px; max-height: 153px;"
              alt="PMC = Preventive Maintenance and Calibration" src="images/support-PMC-icon.png">
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://roos.com/docs/RBEH-6XH5L4"
                Title="Calibration - Written Procedure for Complete Cassini System Cal">Full System Calibration</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://roos.com/docs/TDOO-5YFTTN" Title="Preventive Maintenance Procedure">Preventive
                Maintenance
                Procedure</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://roos.com/pdf/RoosCalibrationScope_v2.0.pdf">Calibration Scope</a></li>
            <li>Perform Annually</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="main">Calibration of a Cassini TIMs with valid Extended Warranty (W) and Software Subscription (S)
            contract.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h2>Engineering Services</h2>
            <img class="centerImg" style="max-width: 114px; max-height: 153px;" alt="'E' = Engineering Services"
              src="images/support-E-icon.png">
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Turn Key Applications</li>
            <li>Device Interface</li>
            <li>Cassini Configuration</li>
            <li>Production Workflow Management</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="main">
            Direct access to Engineering development time to solve your most challenging IC production issues. Reduce
            risk and improve time-to-market with rapid, custom features and changes to the Cassini platform to
            maintain
            your competitive advantage.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img alt="Next Section" src="images/section_divider.png">
      <h2>Spare Test Instrument Modules (TIMs)</h2>
      <p class="main">
        Maintain remarkable production uptime with spare TIMs. Purchase on-site spares or join one of our Spare TIM
        programs. Extended Warranty is required, does not include shipping costs, and failed TIM must be returned to
        factory.
      </p>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h2>Loaner TIMs</h2>
            <img class="centerImg" style="max-width: 114px; max-height: 153px;" alt="'L' = Loaner TIMs"
              src="images/support-L-icon.png">
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Cost Effective</li>
            <li>Gets System Up</li>
            <li>No on-site spare requirements!</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="main">
            Provides a quick replacement while the failed TIM is being repaired. Replaced with a similar TIM with
            equivalent functionality. TIM loaner pool is shared between all participating ATE. If a spare TIM is not
            available in the pool, repairing the failed
            TIM will take priority over all other service needs.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h2>Exchange TIMs</h2>
            <img class="centerImg" style="max-width: 114px; max-height: 153px;" alt="'S' = Exchange TIMs"
              src="images/support-X-icon.png">
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Only 1 Calibration</li>
            <li>Reduces <abbr title="Mean Time To Repair">MTTR</abbr></li>
            <li>Fastest Option</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="main">
            Includes quick shipment for replacing a failed TIM. Identical TIM model is a permanent replacement. Only one
            calibration may be required, minimizing downtime.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="text-center">
            <h2>Upgrade TIMs</h2>
            <img class="centerImg" style="max-width: 114px; max-height: 153px;" alt="'U' = Upgrade TIMs"
              src="images/support-U-icon.png">

          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Latest Hardware Technology</li>
            <li>Maximize Productivity</li>
            <li>Exclusive to RI TIMS</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="main">
            Includes quick shipment for replacing a failed TIM with a functionally better model (if available). Like a
            "Hardware Subscription", the customer will always have the latest and greatest instrument hardware.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
